      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brooklyn%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2023, Landmarks Illinois named Brooklyn a Most Endangered Historic Place, citing population decline and economic challenges.",
